 3.4.12"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"36–39"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"46–49"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"content_revision","html":"2026-10-14"},{"key":"content_review_scope","html":"local formal-language and dependency review; no proof-assistant verification; no new source-page check"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_0\">\\(\\Gamma_0\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3df370596a981512\" href=\"?note=3df370596a981512\" title=\"18-df-feferman-schutte-ordinal\">18-df-feferman-schutte-ordinal</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Epsilon}\">\\(\\mathrm{Epsilon}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f61399ef66a953f9\" href=\"?note=f61399ef66a953f9\" title=\"18-df-epsilon-ordinal\">18-df-epsilon-ordinal</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"40176d5c80238174\" href=\"?note=40176d5c80238174\" title=\"18-df-veblen-hierarchy\">18-df-veblen-hierarchy</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\omega^{\\Gamma_0}=\\Gamma_0\\land\\Gamma_0\\in\\mathrm{Epsilon}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\omega^{\\Gamma_0}=\\Gamma_0\\land\\Gamma_0\\in\\mathrm{Epsilon}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>笔记内推导：Γ₀=φ_{Γ₀}(0)&gt;0，故其属于零层 φ₀ 的不动点类；φ₀(ξ)=ω^ξ。这里只把所核原书定义与吸收律组合成直接推论，不虚构原书定理编号。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-veblen-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"40176d5c80238174","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-v